## 6. End-to-End Testing Checklist

* [ ] `[http://127.0.0.1:8000/userplagrism/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/userplagrism/)` loads properly.
* [ ] Scanning a passage from an indexed IEEE paper flags high plagiarism ($>90\%$).
* [ ] Clicking **Download Full Forensic Report (PDF)** downloads a generated ReportLab PDF.
* [ ] `[http://127.0.0.1:8000/plagiarism-history/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/plagiarism-history/)` lists past scans with working pagination.
* [ ] `[http://127.0.0.1:8000/userimageforgery/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/userimageforgery/)` displays RGB and ELA images side-by-side.
* [ ] `[http://127.0.0.1:8000/forgery-history/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/forgery-history/)` logs all past image authenticity checks.